      "Value": "The Test Technician III performs intermediate level product testing, qualification, and analytical activities that ensure product performance, reliability, and safety prior to retail release. This role executes structured test procedures, conducts functional and durability testing, and performs detailed inspections of internal product components to identify quality or performance issues. Operating semi independently, the Test Technician III troubleshoots specialized test equipment and fixtures, applies intermediate technical judgment, and supports resolution of complex product issues.<br><br>The position contributes technical insight across product development teams by preparing samples, collecting accurate test data, and producing clear, well documented test results. With a growing depth of product and tool knowledge, the Test Technician III assists in improving test methods, evaluating product construction and performance, and recommending enhancements when appropriate.<br><br>The role upholds strict safety, confidentiality, and laboratory standards while maintaining an organized, well functioning lab environment. The Test Technician III is expected to manage assigned work responsibly, collaborate effectively with QA Engineering and cross functional partners, and support field assignments as needed.",
